{"reviewId": "13600934_85YSJILZG", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "黄金作为避险资产，原油作为生产资料，两者的比值，更放大了经济的景气程度。在萎缩期，流动资金进入黄金，炒高黄金价格；同时工业生产弱势，石油供大于求价格降低，两者的比值更加显著", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "黄金作为康波中的货币，对其购买力的检验依据其相对于其他大宗商品的价格比率。在这方面，黄金-原油价格比率是被广泛应用的指标", "range": "24628-24688", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "13600934_85YSJILZG", "userVid": 13600934, "topics": [], "createTime": 1767787079, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 13600934, "name": "牛思彬", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIZ6mhQZhOR3aRKgzGaUKhCBvYD6PVtM03c07Gk4pCZDLXdjTdIIpibUNibv0es3qSUib97yPNxvcBCMHA4vtgjQuHvn3KIG78XA7plHibxjs2g6w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 38, "likes": [{"userVid": 926915999, "name": "周末Joey", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELDSrj32ib3vMjeV3iaPRddbo1ac6kkuicIM7bV082kGVCWQPqZicn1D1FSuA0MNyXlEMrdawBseicCrPsfaXXx9rYHI36pY4DCwAicX54XiarXbL6icg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "但是从文中例图上来看，萧条期也只有很小的一段峰值，其他时间金油比都处于低位，还没回升期金油比高，感觉理论和例图差别很大", "reviewId": "13600934_85YSJILZG", "commentId": "13600934_85YSJILZG_c908765448_86Qj97xLa